[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Audio Playback Test Specification
UID: YAAP-APTS
DATE: @GIT_COMMIT_DATETIME
PREFIX: APTS-

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @test_grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Introduction

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document defines the test specification for Yet Another Audio Player 
(Yaap), a time accurate desktop audio player.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: File Handling

[TEST]
UID: APTS-001
TITLE: FLAC Format and Encoding Identification
TEST_TYPE: Functional
TEST_LEVEL: Integration
PRECONDITIONS: A valid FLAC audio file is available
INPUTS: A valid FLAC audio stream
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the FLAC audio stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the identified format and encoding.
<<<
EXPECTED_RESULT: >>>
The software identifies the stream's format as FLAC and its encoding as FLAC.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall verify that the software correctly identifies the format and
encoding of a valid FLAC audio stream.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: APLLSR-001

[[/SECTION]]
